        <mxCell id="p2-cach-doc" parent="p2-1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Cách đọc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#E0F2FE;color:#0369A1;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Xanh dương · Web&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; · &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#F3E8FF;color:#7E22CE;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tím · Admin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; · &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#DCFCE7;color:#15803D;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Xanh lá · API&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; · &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#E5E7EB;color:#334155;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Xám · PostgreSQL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; · &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FEF3C7;color:#B45309;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Vàng · Ghi chú&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; · &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#334155;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Trắng · Người dùng / hệ thống ngoài&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; Nét liền: thành phần và phụ thuộc khởi động hiện có. Nét đứt: thành phần tuỳ chọn hoặc chưa có." style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#B45309;">
